# Gitignored files copied into a fresh dev worktree/workspace. This one file is
# consumed by BOTH worktrunk (`wt step copy-ignored`) and Conductor
# (https://conductor.build/docs/reference/files-to-copy) — same .gitignore syntax.
# A file is copied only if it is BOTH gitignored AND matched here. Keep it to
# secret-bearing env files a fresh worktree cannot reconstruct — never add
# node_modules/.venv/.next (pnpm store + `nx run api:sync` rebuild those fast) and
# never add .env.worktree (each worktree mints its own via `mise run wt:env`).
apps/api/.env
apps/web/.env
apps/web/.env.local
apps/mobile/.env
apps/bots/.env
.claude/settings.local.json